 buyers to clearly visualize how the product will look and feel on themselves.\n\nDesigned for ecommerce and D2C brands, this format is ideal for product listings, helping improve clarity, trust, and conversion by showcasing the product from every essential angle.\nEnhanced through advanced post-production processes like compositing, color grading, and upscaling, the final output is production-ready for listings, ads, and catalogues.\n\nV4B.ai enables brands to create high-quality, conversion-focused fashion content at scale without physical shoots, reducing production costs by up to 80 percent while maintaining premium visual standards.\n\nEvery model, apparel, environment, animation, and detail is produced using our unique proprietary CGI, VFX & AI production pipeline powered by our high-end GPU computers, enabling brands to create high-end appliance ad films without studios, cameras, or live production. Even before we start production, our AI-powered CGI experts use shared and available product images to create perfect digital double / precise 3D model of client’s product for product accuracy in the final video\n\n🔗 Learn more: https://www.v4b.ai\n📩 Business inquiries: grow@v4b.ai\n\nV4b.ai is an Agency creating Content & Videos Without Any Physical Shoot, using high-end GPU Computers powering CGI, VFX, and AI, operated by specialists. Our production-grade pipelines outperform prompt-based GenAI platforms, delivering cinematic Ad Films, eCommerce Videos, and more from Concept to Final Cut. \n\neCommerce/D2C Listing Videos - Most D2C buyers abandon eCom pages without completing a purchase as they aren’t convinced by images alone. Even before we start production, our AI-powered CGI experts use shared and available product images to create perfect digital double / precise 3D model of client’s product for product accuracy in the final video, then producing Marketplace-Optimized Videos & Images, that increase ‘Add-to-Cart’ by building customer trust, ready to get listed on Amazon, Shopify & more.\n\nFrom Concept to Final Cut, we create Ad Films - Our custom production tech-stack helps our creative team with realistic environments, lifelike AI humans, multi-language voiceovers and dialogues. No sets. No actors. Just Platform-Optimized Films ready for Youtube, Meta, TV, OTT & more.\n\n#AIAdFilm #AICommercial #AIVideoProduction #AIGeneratedVideo #GenerativeAI\n#CGICommercial #CGIAd #VFXCommercial #VFXAd\n#VirtualProduction #NoShootAd #VirtualAd\n#FutureOfAdvertising #AIInMarketing #DigitalAdvertising\n#BrandFilm #AdFilm #ProductAd #3DCommercial", "channel_id": "UCjK5oJeQtU8o7gE89FLAMZw", "channel_url": "https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCjK5oJeQtU8o7gE89FLAMZw", "duration": 13, "view_count": 14, "age_limit": 0, "webpage_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=l3KcTtz1rio", "categories": ["Film & Animation"], "tags": ["AI fashion video", "no shoot fashion video", "virtual fashion production", "CGI fashion ads", "AI generated fashion models", "digital fashion campaign", "fashion video without photoshoot", "AI apparel videos", "virtual try-on fashion video", "eCommerce fashion video AI", "fashion content without shooting", "AI clothing visualization", "fashion brand AI marketing", "video production without shoot", "AI lookbook video"], "playable_in_embed": true, "live_status": "not_live", "media_type": "video", "_format_sort_fields": ["quality", "res", "fps", "hdr:12", "source", "vcodec", "channels", "acodec", "lang", "proto"], "automatic_captions": {"en-orig": [{"ext": "json3", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/api/timedtext?v=l3KcTtz1rio&ei=OyhWau69E9vli9oPkIXKiQY&caps=asr&opi=112496729&xoaf=5&xowf=1&xospf=1&hl=en&ip=0.0.0.0&ipbits=0&expire=1784056491&sparams=ip%2Cipbits%2Cexpire%2Cv%2Cei%2Ccaps%2Copi%2Cxoaf&signature=6CBF2A87E3E04413400ADDB90158E319DC884124.3D5CF99B04AA3882E5D758C90DBB1C57A2ED9586&key=yt8&kind=asr&lang=en&variant=gemini&fmt=json3", "name": "English (Original)", "impersonate": true}, {"ext": "srv1", "url": "https://www.